    "noteId": "array-boundaries",
    "lessonSlug": "arrays",
    "question": {
      "type": "CHOICE",
      "difficulty": "EASY",
      "prompt": "遍历长度为 0 的数组时，如果循环从 i = 0 开始并用 i <= values.length 作为条件，会发生什么？",
      "explanation": "条件 0 <= 0 成立，循环会尝试读取下标 0。空数组没有合法下标，因此抛出 ArrayIndexOutOfBoundsException。",
      "options": [
        "A. 循环体不会执行",
        "B. 第一次读取 values[0] 时越界",
        "C. values[0] 自动得到 0",
        "D. 数组会自动扩容"
      ],
      "answerKey": "B"
    },
    "exercise": {
      "title": "统计相邻上升次数",
      "description": "输入第一项为整数 n（0 到 1000），后面是 n 个整数。统计相邻元素中，右边严格大于左边的次数，输出一个整数。数组为空或只有一个元素时输出 0。\n\n示例输入\n5\n2 4 4 -1 3\n\n示例输出\n2",
      "difficulty": "BEGINNER",
      "hint": "第一个可比较的右侧元素下标是 1。比较 values[i - 1] 与 values[i]。",
      "sortOrder": 101,
      "starterCode": [
        "import java.util.Scanner;",
        "",
        "public class Main {",
        "    static int countRises(int[] values) {",
        "        throw new UnsupportedOperationException(\"请完成方法\");",
        "    }",
        "",
        "    public static void main(String[] args) {",
        "        try (Scanner input = new Scanner(System.in)) {",
        "            int[] values = new int[input.nextInt()];",
        "            for (int i = 0; i < values.length; i++) {",
        "                values[i] = input.nextInt();",
        "            }",
        "            System.out.println(countRises(values));",
        "        }",
        "    }",
        "}"
      ],
      "solutionBody": [
        "        int rises = 0;",
        "        for (int i = 1; i < values.length; i++) {",
        "            if (values[i] > values[i - 1]) {",
        "                rises++;",
        "            }",
        "        }",
        "        return rises;"
      ],
      "cases": [
        {
          "name": "常规数组",
          "stdin": "5\n2 4 4 -1 3\n",
          "expected": "2"
        },
        {
          "name": "空数组",
          "stdin": "0\n",
          "expected": "0"
        },
        {
          "name": "单元素",
          "stdin": "1\n7\n",
          "expected": "0"
        },
        {
          "name": "没有严格上升",
          "stdin": "5\n5 5 2 -1 -2\n",
          "expected": "0"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
